Package: surveytools
Type: Package
Title: Clean, Describe and Model Small Survey Data
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Example", "Engineering", email = "engineering@example.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates a plausible survey, cleans it, describes each column,
    and fits a linear model with tidy coefficients. Written for teaching the
    shape of an analysis rather than for production use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://github.com/example/surveytools
BugReports: https://github.com/example/surveytools/issues
